{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S07、S11略微把焦点转向自己是否会被对方需要、对方以后是否还会想到自己，带入了一些关于自身关系位置的顾虑；但这些顾虑仍然围绕亲密本身展开，没有取代对眼前幸福及其不可留住的感受。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S07、S09将亲密关系中的幸福与失去，具体改写成对方是否需要自己的陪伴、是否愿意和自己待在一起，主线偏向被需要和被选择的焦虑。\",\n    \"S11把痛楚落在对方未来是否愿意继续陪伴，S13进一步转向希望听到对方承诺不会改变、又怀疑承诺是否可靠。这使主线逐渐变成对关系持续性和未来保证的担忧，而不再主要是亲密的幸福与时光无法留住之间的纠缠。\",\n    \"S14虽然回到珍惜当下、不强求永远，但前面的承诺需求已经使整条线更偏向寻求关系确定性。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X始终让亲密带来的甜蜜、对美好时刻终将过去的舍不得，以及因为珍惜而更加痛苦彼此交织，尤其S11至S14直接呈现了幸福越浓、越无法留住就越疼的核心。Y则逐渐把这种痛楚收窄为对方是否需要自己、是否愿意继续陪伴以及能否给出不变的保证，讲成了与Center相近但更具体的关系确认问题。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d9e9e7eb-d635-47ad-a528-327e5fc12a4a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T102227072883Z", "elapsed_seconds": 18.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:22:45.903863+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c1e18d43b9f067d3091d312e18bc28ba44fd8f0a20fe618b8e7b54d75dbd5d1d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48"